1
00:01:01,560 --> 00:01:06,160
Taming The Husband

2
00:01:06,760 --> 00:01:08,760
Episode 11

3
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:19,000
Watch your step!

4
00:01:19,640 --> 00:01:20,640
Careful, my lord.

5
00:01:21,680 --> 00:01:23,680
Young Master Xie,
I'm Tian Mancang,

6
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:25,440
the steward of these grain ships.

7
00:01:25,520 --> 00:01:28,680
From now on,
I'll be here to run your errands.

8
00:01:28,760 --> 00:01:31,200
Whatever you need,
I'll go through fire for you,

9
00:01:31,280 --> 00:01:32,280
even if it costs me my life!

10
00:01:32,680 --> 00:01:33,680
Thank you.

11
00:01:34,040 --> 00:01:36,040
Young Master Xie, this way, please.

12
00:01:48,760 --> 00:01:50,480
This is granary-aged rice.

13
00:01:50,640 --> 00:01:53,280
It comes from
the bottom of the government granaries.

14
00:01:53,520 --> 00:01:57,080
Stored against wood for years,
the rice gradually changes,

15
00:01:57,160 --> 00:01:59,200
developing a rich, toasted aroma.

16
00:01:59,520 --> 00:02:02,040
It's very much in demand.

17
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:05,960
I see.
You learn something every day.

18
00:02:06,520 --> 00:02:07,520
Here.

19
00:02:08,360 --> 00:02:10,120
Young Master Xie,
please.

20
00:02:10,280 --> 00:02:11,280
Young Master Xie,

21
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:14,400
have you played
Tiger, Chicken, Worm, Stick?

22
00:02:14,640 --> 00:02:17,040
Tigers eat chickens.
Chickens eat worms.

23
00:02:18,160 --> 00:02:21,880
The people you see here
are the worms of this dock.

24
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:23,800
Look.

25
00:02:24,280 --> 00:02:26,400
Those poor seamstresses
mend clothes and sails.

26
00:02:26,840 --> 00:02:29,440
These are transport workers.
They move and stack the grain.

27
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:32,040
Up there are the boatmen,
repairing the ships.

28
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:34,120
These men measure the water's depth.

29
00:02:34,200 --> 00:02:36,280
They report back,
working from dawn till dusk.

30
00:02:36,360 --> 00:02:38,720
These people
are the smallest and least important.

31
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:40,840
That's why they're
the worms of this dock.

32
00:02:41,360 --> 00:02:46,880
As for the chickens, besides me,
the steward, there's one other.

33
00:02:49,320 --> 00:02:51,200
Young Master Xie,
this way.

34
00:02:52,480 --> 00:02:53,480
Take your time.

35
00:02:54,200 --> 00:02:56,920
This is our bookkeeper,
Zheng Youyu.

36
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:58,520
When the worms finish their work,

37
00:02:58,600 --> 00:03:01,080
they take their bamboo tallies
to the chickens to collect their wages.

38
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:03,000
Come on, come on, come on.
Make way! Make way!

39
00:03:03,440 --> 00:03:06,360
So this is chickens eating worms?

40
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:08,080
Well…

41
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:11,520
Grain transport
is still a business.

42
00:03:11,600 --> 00:03:13,360
And business costs money.

43
00:03:13,440 --> 00:03:15,240
So taking a cut is only natural.

44
00:03:16,440 --> 00:03:17,440
Where's my money?

45
00:03:24,680 --> 00:03:25,680
Next!

46
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:28,240
Is that all I get?

47
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:36,760
So, this is how
you keep the books?

48
00:03:44,360 --> 00:03:45,760
Young Master Xie!

49
00:03:45,840 --> 00:03:47,280
Look at me. I completely forgot

50
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:48,800
to come and welcome you myself.

51
00:03:49,320 --> 00:03:50,440
I should be slapped! Slapped!

52
00:03:51,680 --> 00:03:52,680
I can't hear you.

53
00:03:54,600 --> 00:03:55,600
What was that?

54
00:03:56,200 --> 00:03:57,440
Those slaps are too quiet.

55
00:03:57,520 --> 00:03:58,520
I can't hear them.

56
00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:05,080
I should be slapped! Slapped!

57
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:07,440
I deserve it! Harder!

58
00:04:11,880 --> 00:04:13,200
Worms may be small,

59
00:04:13,480 --> 00:04:15,000
but there are a lot of them.

60
00:04:15,600 --> 00:04:17,520
If I ever catch you
doing this again,

61
00:04:18,520 --> 00:04:19,920
you'll answer to me.

62
00:04:20,120 --> 00:04:21,560
Yes! Yes!

63
00:04:22,080 --> 00:04:23,080
They're the worms.

64
00:04:23,440 --> 00:04:24,440
I'm just a chicken.

65
00:04:24,840 --> 00:04:26,400
And you're the great tiger!

66
00:04:26,520 --> 00:04:28,800
Whatever you command,
we'll follow it to the letter,

67
00:04:28,960 --> 00:04:31,360
like an imperial decree!
An imperial decree!

68
00:04:39,520 --> 00:04:40,520
Here.

69
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:41,720
Me?

70
00:04:43,160 --> 00:04:44,160
Here.

71
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:48,760
Sir! Sir, you're a good man!

72
00:04:48,840 --> 00:04:51,600
Thank you, sir!
May you live a long, happy life!

73
00:04:53,160 --> 00:04:54,160
Tian Mancang.

74
00:04:54,720 --> 00:04:55,720
Yes, sir?

75
00:04:55,840 --> 00:04:58,640
Stay here and watch him.
I'll take a look outside.

76
00:04:58,760 --> 00:04:59,880
Of course. Take care, sir.

77
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:01,600
Take care.

78
00:05:06,720 --> 00:05:07,720
Stop pushing! Line up!

79
00:05:17,080 --> 00:05:19,400
My lord, you know
old rice when you see it.

80
00:05:19,480 --> 00:05:20,640
Why pretend you don't?

81
00:05:20,880 --> 00:05:24,360
And we've only just arrived.
Aren't we making too much of a fuss?

82
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:26,440
They've put on a show for us.

83
00:05:27,080 --> 00:05:30,520
It would be rude not to play along.

84
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:37,840
I thought
he might actually be capable.

85
00:05:38,480 --> 00:05:40,680
One little test was all it took.

86
00:05:40,800 --> 00:05:42,400
Not half as shrewd as First Master Xie.

87
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:44,800
I don't get it.
What's First Master Xie so afraid of?

88
00:05:44,880 --> 00:05:46,200
Why does he keep telling us

89
00:05:46,640 --> 00:05:48,160
to put him through his paces?

90
00:05:48,240 --> 00:05:49,240
Afraid?

91
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:53,040
He knows tigers eat chickens
and chickens eat worms.

92
00:05:53,400 --> 00:05:56,200
He forgets worms gnaw through sticks,
and sticks beat tigers.

93
00:05:57,520 --> 00:05:59,400
Let's see how that tiger likes

94
00:06:00,280 --> 00:06:02,000
a good beating from us!

95
00:06:04,840 --> 00:06:07,720
Virtue sustains all things

96
00:06:12,640 --> 00:06:15,920
They all used to keep their distance.

97
00:06:16,440 --> 00:06:17,680
Now look.

98
00:06:19,280 --> 00:06:21,320
They're swarming around him.

99
00:06:23,440 --> 00:06:25,440
People have no shame anymore.

100
00:06:25,960 --> 00:06:28,120
Jianwei came with a message.

101
00:06:28,440 --> 00:06:30,280
Young Master Xie went to the docks today.

102
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:31,720
There's some trouble there,

103
00:06:32,080 --> 00:06:34,160
so he'll stay a few days
to oversee the work.

104
00:06:34,560 --> 00:06:36,240
He won't be coming home for now.

105
00:06:36,520 --> 00:06:37,520
I see.

106
00:06:37,960 --> 00:06:42,280
Shall I send a few capable people
to help him?

107
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:47,360
A blade left to rust needs a good
sharpening before it's fit for use.

108
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:50,840
A visit to thank you

109
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:52,200
The Huang family.

110
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:04,720
Huang Youqing
The Huang family's legitimate daughter

111
00:07:05,160 --> 00:07:07,520
Youqing, don't worry.

112
00:07:07,800 --> 00:07:10,680
We broke off the engagement last year,
but we never got around

113
00:07:10,760 --> 00:07:12,880
to registering it
at the Yangzhou county office.

114
00:07:13,200 --> 00:07:16,760
The marriage can still be arranged.

115
00:07:17,600 --> 00:07:19,440
We were the ones marrying up.

116
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:22,040
Then their fortunes fell,
and you looked down on them.

117
00:07:22,120 --> 00:07:23,160
You called it off.

118
00:07:24,160 --> 00:07:25,160
Now you're going back?

119
00:07:25,240 --> 00:07:26,640
How can I face them?

120
00:07:26,720 --> 00:07:28,600
Forget your pride.

121
00:07:28,680 --> 00:07:32,080
You'll have all the wealth you could want.

122
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:33,600
Exactly.

123
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:35,680
Youqing, don't worry.

124
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:38,000
Things are different now.

125
00:07:38,120 --> 00:07:39,200
Last month, Father

126
00:07:39,280 --> 00:07:41,160
became an assistant director
of the Ministry of Revenue.

127
00:07:41,400 --> 00:07:43,800
That's a full-fledged
junior fourth-rank official!

128
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:46,240
What do the Xies have?
A bit of filthy money!

129
00:07:46,320 --> 00:07:48,000
It buys fine horses and carriages,

130
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:50,440
but can it buy
that kind of power?

131
00:07:53,400 --> 00:07:56,000
The Xie estate

132
00:08:04,120 --> 00:08:05,760
Not long ago,

133
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:07,480
I saw your grandson.

134
00:08:08,080 --> 00:08:10,960
It was so busy and crowded,

135
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:12,960
I didn't get to greet him.

136
00:08:13,440 --> 00:08:14,440
And now

137
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:17,240
you're here for a spring outing.

138
00:08:18,040 --> 00:08:21,640
It was kind of you to stop by.

139
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:23,640
I appreciate the gesture,

140
00:08:23,760 --> 00:08:26,880
but this gift is far too much.

141
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:28,320
I can't accept it.

142
00:08:40,520 --> 00:08:41,520
Get up.

143
00:08:42,160 --> 00:08:43,160
Come and kneel here.

144
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:53,840
The last time he was in town,

145
00:08:53,920 --> 00:08:55,640
he got caught up in other things

146
00:08:55,800 --> 00:08:57,520
and failed to pay his respects.

147
00:08:57,960 --> 00:08:59,600
He had his reasons,

148
00:09:00,400 --> 00:09:02,200
but it was still rude of him.

149
00:09:02,640 --> 00:09:05,440
I scolded him as soon as I heard.

150
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:10,720
I've brought him here today to apologize.

151
00:09:10,920 --> 00:09:13,960
Please. We're just common folk.

152
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:16,040
This town isn't ours.

153
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:17,600
Do get up.

154
00:09:21,840 --> 00:09:24,760
Good fortune comes to those who give.

155
00:09:25,600 --> 00:09:27,160
Please accept it,

156
00:09:27,240 --> 00:09:29,960
and let us share in your good fortune.

157
00:09:30,280 --> 00:09:32,120
Last month, Youqing's father

158
00:09:32,200 --> 00:09:33,320
was in the capital,

159
00:09:33,440 --> 00:09:35,680
and Minister Ye helped him advance.

160
00:09:36,040 --> 00:09:38,560
Our friends and relatives all sent gifts.

161
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:42,000
Speaking of Minister Ye,

162
00:09:43,400 --> 00:09:45,400
he's not only your father-in-law,

163
00:09:45,520 --> 00:09:47,320
but my son's mentor, too.

164
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:50,720
So we're already connected, aren't we?

165
00:09:51,800 --> 00:09:53,520
That shipping festival

166
00:09:53,920 --> 00:09:57,200
has kept everyone here run off their feet.

167
00:09:57,280 --> 00:09:59,160
What good fortune?

168
00:09:59,840 --> 00:10:01,840
Still, Yangzhou's a fine place.

169
00:10:02,600 --> 00:10:05,440
Prosperous, with plenty of fish and rice.

170
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:07,840
But in this town,

171
00:10:08,120 --> 00:10:09,760
the lanes run every which way.

172
00:10:10,240 --> 00:10:13,080
So many twists and turns.

173
00:10:13,600 --> 00:10:15,120
I'm getting old,

174
00:10:15,360 --> 00:10:17,200
and my memory's failing.

175
00:10:17,600 --> 00:10:19,120
Luckily, Yan

176
00:10:19,400 --> 00:10:22,160
married a capable woman.

177
00:10:22,720 --> 00:10:25,320
She knows her way around.

178
00:10:26,280 --> 00:10:28,680
I'll ask her when I get back,

179
00:10:28,840 --> 00:10:30,960
then send someone to let you know.

180
00:10:32,560 --> 00:10:35,160
Have you found somewhere to stay?

181
00:10:40,760 --> 00:10:41,760
Wanjun.

182
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:44,440
Mother?

183
00:10:44,560 --> 00:10:47,080
Find them somewhere suitable.

184
00:10:47,160 --> 00:10:48,440
See that they're well looked after.

185
00:10:49,280 --> 00:10:50,280
Yes.

186
00:10:51,680 --> 00:10:52,680
I…

187
00:10:53,960 --> 00:10:56,440
I think one of my headaches is coming on.

188
00:10:56,720 --> 00:10:57,720
Matron Fang,

189
00:10:58,640 --> 00:11:00,360
help me to my room.

190
00:11:01,280 --> 00:11:03,800
Then… if you'll excuse me.

191
00:11:15,920 --> 00:11:17,480
My grandchildren and I

192
00:11:17,920 --> 00:11:22,240
came all the way from the capital
in all sincerity.

193
00:11:22,440 --> 00:11:25,200
Breaking off the engagement
was our fault.

194
00:11:25,360 --> 00:11:27,080
My grandson was a fool!

195
00:11:27,280 --> 00:11:31,440
I've dragged him here myself,
along with Youqing.

196
00:11:31,640 --> 00:11:33,240
I've swallowed my pride.

197
00:11:33,680 --> 00:11:37,320
We're here to apologize to your family.

198
00:11:37,600 --> 00:11:39,880
Please let bygones be bygones.

199
00:11:40,520 --> 00:11:44,760
We bow before you and beg forgiveness.

200
00:11:44,840 --> 00:11:46,680
No, no, no! No need!
No need! No need!

201
00:11:49,840 --> 00:11:53,480
The Xie family is truly generous.

202
00:11:53,840 --> 00:11:55,800
Let's speak plainly.

203
00:11:56,200 --> 00:11:59,280
The Huangs have some standing, too.

204
00:11:59,760 --> 00:12:01,800
If our families were joined,

205
00:12:02,280 --> 00:12:04,000
we'd both be stronger for it.

206
00:12:04,600 --> 00:12:08,120
Just say the word, and it's settled.

207
00:12:09,920 --> 00:12:13,360
It's true parents
and matchmakers decide marriages,

208
00:12:13,520 --> 00:12:15,680
but this is Yan's own marriage.

209
00:12:15,880 --> 00:12:17,720
We should hear what he wants.

210
00:12:17,800 --> 00:12:18,840
Madam Huang,

211
00:12:19,960 --> 00:12:23,160
only an emperor's word is law.

212
00:12:23,920 --> 00:12:25,400
Madam just told you,

213
00:12:25,640 --> 00:12:27,200
we're common folk.

214
00:12:27,680 --> 00:12:31,840
We simply follow our family rules
and our ancestors' teachings.

215
00:12:32,400 --> 00:12:33,520
Since you're here,

216
00:12:33,760 --> 00:12:36,200
if you'd like to see the sights,

217
00:12:36,360 --> 00:12:38,120
we'd be happy to help.

218
00:12:39,640 --> 00:12:41,560
We were hoping to look around.

219
00:12:41,800 --> 00:12:44,480
Someone to show us the way
would be most welcome.

220
00:12:45,160 --> 00:12:47,960
I just heard there's someone here

221
00:12:48,440 --> 00:12:50,680
who knows the place very well.

222
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:05,040
You forgot your gift.

223
00:13:05,440 --> 00:13:06,680
Wait, please! Wait!

224
00:13:07,600 --> 00:13:08,840
Please, all three of you!

225
00:13:10,760 --> 00:13:13,840
I'm Xie Rongchang,
of the senior branch of the Xie family.

226
00:13:14,040 --> 00:13:17,000
Grain business kept me busy,
so I couldn't greet you earlier.

227
00:13:17,080 --> 00:13:18,360
Please forgive me.

228
00:13:19,120 --> 00:13:21,440
I hear you'll be
staying a few days.

229
00:13:22,000 --> 00:13:23,320
I know this place well.

230
00:13:23,400 --> 00:13:26,120
If there's anything you need,
just ask me.

231
00:13:30,120 --> 00:13:31,200
Thank you.

232
00:13:31,320 --> 00:13:33,080
Thank you.

233
00:13:33,600 --> 00:13:35,440
Your grandson has such fine manners.

234
00:13:35,520 --> 00:13:37,480
As one would expect of a good family.

235
00:13:38,560 --> 00:13:40,680
My son is about their age,

236
00:13:41,560 --> 00:13:43,280
but always busy with grain transport.

237
00:13:43,360 --> 00:13:45,600
Perhaps one of these days,

238
00:13:45,760 --> 00:13:50,080
the young people
could get to know each other.

239
00:13:54,400 --> 00:13:56,800
The Xie estate

240
00:14:05,640 --> 00:14:07,240
Two generations of concubines' sons,

241
00:14:07,960 --> 00:14:09,680
and he dares to parade him around!

242
00:14:11,880 --> 00:14:13,920
The ones who want us,
we don't want.

243
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:16,200
And the ones we want
don't want us!

244
00:14:16,280 --> 00:14:17,920
That Xie family!

245
00:14:19,520 --> 00:14:21,200
Grandmother,
were you really going to

246
00:14:21,280 --> 00:14:23,040
let that country girl show you around?

247
00:14:23,880 --> 00:14:25,320
Don't be so stupid!

248
00:14:25,400 --> 00:14:26,800
Can't you see?

249
00:14:26,960 --> 00:14:29,560
They're using that concubine
to shut us out.

250
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:32,640
Get her out of the way,

251
00:14:33,080 --> 00:14:35,920
and the match is as good as made.

252
00:14:37,640 --> 00:14:39,320
Grandmother's right.

253
00:14:39,480 --> 00:14:41,440
If this concubine dies, too,

254
00:14:41,640 --> 00:14:44,240
it'll only prove
Xie Yan's a curse on his wives.

255
00:14:44,400 --> 00:14:45,640
Who but Youqing

256
00:14:45,720 --> 00:14:47,000
would dare marry him then?

257
00:14:47,560 --> 00:14:48,760
You can't hurt her!

258
00:14:50,240 --> 00:14:52,760
They've said no,
which suits me just fine.

259
00:14:53,400 --> 00:14:55,520
I'm going to a Taoist temple
to find a master and learn swordplay.

260
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:57,000
Stop right there!

261
00:14:58,080 --> 00:15:00,720
What do you mean, learn swordplay?
Swords all day, every day!

262
00:15:02,040 --> 00:15:03,720
Carry on like that,
and who'll ever marry you?

263
00:15:04,600 --> 00:15:05,600
All right, all right, all right.

264
00:15:06,040 --> 00:15:07,720
We won't touch her.

265
00:15:08,400 --> 00:15:09,400
Youqing,

266
00:15:09,720 --> 00:15:12,720
raising you hasn't been easy
for our family, has it?

267
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:14,840
Now we need you.

268
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:17,040
You have to do your part.

269
00:15:17,280 --> 00:15:19,320
Besides, Xie Yan

270
00:15:19,600 --> 00:15:22,160
may be just
a tiny bit less impressive than me,

271
00:15:22,360 --> 00:15:24,440
but as your husband,
he's more than good enough.

272
00:15:24,520 --> 00:15:25,800
You'll see when you meet him.

273
00:15:28,080 --> 00:15:29,240
Where are you going?

274
00:15:29,680 --> 00:15:30,920
You wanted sword training, didn't you?

275
00:15:31,320 --> 00:15:33,160
There's a school here in Yangzhou,

276
00:15:33,480 --> 00:15:34,800
deep in the mountains.

277
00:15:34,880 --> 00:15:37,960
I'll ask that gentleman
to find us a few local men

278
00:15:38,120 --> 00:15:39,960
who can discreetly keep us safe.

279
00:15:40,720 --> 00:15:42,320
Take Grandmother back first.

280
00:15:42,400 --> 00:15:43,400
You--

281
00:15:46,520 --> 00:15:47,520
Come on.

282
00:15:55,800 --> 00:15:57,720
Slow down! Watch your step!

283
00:16:03,800 --> 00:16:05,440
We can't keep up!

284
00:16:05,680 --> 00:16:06,880
You take your time, too.

285
00:16:10,200 --> 00:16:11,800
Careful! Careful! Look at them!

286
00:16:12,200 --> 00:16:13,640
Where have they gone?

287
00:16:13,720 --> 00:16:15,520
Youqing, slow down!

288
00:16:17,480 --> 00:16:18,480
Slow down!

289
00:16:19,560 --> 00:16:20,800
You're good!

290
00:16:21,400 --> 00:16:22,480
Have you had training?

291
00:16:23,080 --> 00:16:24,320
Nothing formal.

292
00:16:24,400 --> 00:16:26,160
Take your time! Watch your step!

293
00:16:26,240 --> 00:16:27,680
You're our honored guests, after all.

294
00:16:29,520 --> 00:16:32,120
I hear you know martial arts.
Is that right?

295
00:16:33,160 --> 00:16:35,120
Want to spar?

296
00:16:36,960 --> 00:16:38,240
Can you beat Yulan?

297
00:16:38,360 --> 00:16:39,800
You've fought Yulan?

298
00:16:40,200 --> 00:16:42,080
You're better than him?

299
00:16:42,200 --> 00:16:44,680
Beat Yulan first, then come and find me.

300
00:16:48,520 --> 00:16:49,520
Youqing!

301
00:16:50,040 --> 00:16:52,320
Why are you running so fast?
Come and give me a hand!

302
00:16:54,520 --> 00:16:55,520
What about your grandmother?

303
00:17:00,480 --> 00:17:01,480
Here.

304
00:17:02,120 --> 00:17:03,120
Here.

305
00:17:11,840 --> 00:17:13,400
Get them! Kill them!

306
00:17:13,640 --> 00:17:14,640
Stop!

307
00:17:20,600 --> 00:17:22,360
Why all the shouting?

308
00:17:22,680 --> 00:17:24,320
If you want money, I'll give it to you.

309
00:17:25,160 --> 00:17:26,160
Smart girl.

310
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:30,240
I'll take the money, and you, too.

311
00:17:30,360 --> 00:17:34,800
I'm taking you back
to be my bandit bride!

312
00:17:36,640 --> 00:17:37,640
Come on!

313
00:17:40,560 --> 00:17:42,280
Sir! What are you doing here?

314
00:17:43,080 --> 00:17:44,080
You tricked me!

315
00:17:45,960 --> 00:17:46,960
You're dead!

316
00:17:47,120 --> 00:17:48,480
Yulan, where are those men you hired?

317
00:17:48,560 --> 00:17:49,560
Why aren't they here yet?

318
00:17:50,400 --> 00:17:52,720
Let's go back.
We didn't see a thing.

319
00:17:52,800 --> 00:17:54,000
Go, go, go! Quick! Quick!

320
00:17:54,080 --> 00:17:55,840
-Let's get out of here!
-Move!

321
00:18:06,320 --> 00:18:08,280
Robbing in silence,
leaving no one alive…

322
00:18:08,680 --> 00:18:09,680
No respect for the rules.

323
00:18:09,760 --> 00:18:10,800
Where did these amateurs come from?

324
00:18:16,880 --> 00:18:18,560
It hurts! It hurts! It hurts!

325
00:18:20,640 --> 00:18:21,960
These are the men you hired?

326
00:18:22,240 --> 00:18:23,440
You're going to get her killed!

327
00:18:24,040 --> 00:18:25,360
Youqing! Careful!

328
00:18:25,440 --> 00:18:26,920
Go and stop her!

329
00:18:27,200 --> 00:18:28,200
Youqing!

330
00:18:28,840 --> 00:18:29,840
Stop!

331
00:18:36,000 --> 00:18:37,040
Yulan!

332
00:18:37,120 --> 00:18:38,120
Let's go! I can't take any more!

333
00:18:38,240 --> 00:18:39,280
Help me!

334
00:18:39,400 --> 00:18:40,400
Yulan!

335
00:18:40,640 --> 00:18:41,640
Hurry! Hurry!

336
00:18:41,760 --> 00:18:42,760
Is everyone all right?

337
00:18:43,880 --> 00:18:44,920
Are you all right?

338
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:46,040
It hurts! It hurts! It hurts!

339
00:18:46,160 --> 00:18:47,880
Who were those people?

340
00:18:48,960 --> 00:18:50,280
Get up! Get up!

341
00:18:50,680 --> 00:18:51,680
Get up!

342
00:18:55,080 --> 00:18:56,080
My shoulder!

343
00:18:56,320 --> 00:18:57,320
It hurts!

344
00:18:57,880 --> 00:18:59,040
It hurts so much!

345
00:18:59,640 --> 00:19:01,640
My back! It hurts! It hurts! It hurts!

346
00:19:01,720 --> 00:19:02,880
My back! That hurts, too!

347
00:19:05,680 --> 00:19:07,600
My backside! That hurts even more!

348
00:19:08,120 --> 00:19:09,400
It hurts, Doctor!

349
00:19:09,560 --> 00:19:11,760
Look. I'm so badly hurt,

350
00:19:11,880 --> 00:19:12,880
I'll have to lie here

351
00:19:12,960 --> 00:19:14,200
for 10 days or two weeks

352
00:19:14,280 --> 00:19:15,680
before I'm better, won't I?

353
00:19:16,800 --> 00:19:18,720
Madam, actually, your grandson--

354
00:19:18,800 --> 00:19:19,800
Thank you, Doctor.

355
00:19:21,640 --> 00:19:22,840
A little something for you.

356
00:19:23,200 --> 00:19:24,200
Please take it.

357
00:19:33,400 --> 00:19:36,400
Clear skies and fresh air
The river flows beyond the horizon

358
00:19:38,520 --> 00:19:39,520
My lady,

359
00:19:40,160 --> 00:19:41,640
Mr. Huang is badly hurt.

360
00:19:41,720 --> 00:19:42,720
His muscles and bones are injured.

361
00:19:43,000 --> 00:19:44,120
His life isn't in danger,

362
00:19:44,520 --> 00:19:45,840
but he'll need several days' rest.

363
00:19:45,920 --> 00:19:46,920
Very well.

364
00:19:47,320 --> 00:19:50,120
Please let Madam know.

365
00:20:01,520 --> 00:20:03,960
All those lively
streets and markets he could visit,

366
00:20:04,120 --> 00:20:05,640
and he had to go to some martial school!

367
00:20:06,120 --> 00:20:07,480
Does he think Madam

368
00:20:07,760 --> 00:20:10,080
doesn't know
what the Huangs are up to?

369
00:20:11,240 --> 00:20:13,680
Never mind. What's done is done.

370
00:20:14,240 --> 00:20:18,080
Let him recover first,
then send them home.

371
00:20:20,000 --> 00:20:22,000
All right. Let me.

372
00:20:27,400 --> 00:20:29,680
Mother, does it still hurt?

373
00:20:35,000 --> 00:20:37,240
Qiao! Keep your voice down.

374
00:20:38,480 --> 00:20:39,480
Why should I?

375
00:20:39,640 --> 00:20:41,640
They won't even give you
a maid to grind your medicine!

376
00:20:42,920 --> 00:20:43,920
Here.

377
00:20:44,080 --> 00:20:45,520
I've found out what's going on.

378
00:20:45,680 --> 00:20:47,520
Mr. Huang has muscle and bone injuries.

379
00:20:47,600 --> 00:20:50,760
He can't be moved,
so he'll recover in the West Courtyard.

380
00:20:51,080 --> 00:20:54,160
His grandmother and Miss Huang
have moved there, too.

381
00:20:54,240 --> 00:20:56,240
Were Lady Zhou and Jin Baozhu punished?

382
00:20:56,720 --> 00:20:57,720
I don't know.

383
00:20:58,240 --> 00:20:59,680
Is that all you can think about?

384
00:20:59,760 --> 00:21:01,240
I know good things take time.

385
00:21:01,400 --> 00:21:03,640
But what if
they do work things out

386
00:21:03,880 --> 00:21:06,040
and come out even stronger?
What do we do then?

387
00:21:06,320 --> 00:21:07,680
The Huangs want the match.

388
00:21:07,920 --> 00:21:09,200
It's all down to him now.

389
00:21:09,760 --> 00:21:11,760
The Huangs are in imperial favor.

390
00:21:13,320 --> 00:21:14,680
At first,

391
00:21:15,320 --> 00:21:17,800
Madam was too angry to agree.

392
00:21:18,200 --> 00:21:19,200
Once she cools down--

393
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:21,000
Mother!

394
00:21:21,600 --> 00:21:23,000
Once she cools down,

395
00:21:23,240 --> 00:21:24,840
who knows what she'll do?

396
00:21:26,360 --> 00:21:29,480
Xi, keep an eye on the West Courtyard.

397
00:21:29,880 --> 00:21:32,600
Find a chance to ruin the match.

398
00:21:32,880 --> 00:21:34,000
Me again?

399
00:21:34,200 --> 00:21:36,000
Why don't you go and charm her yourself?

400
00:21:36,560 --> 00:21:37,960
I have to look after Mother.

401
00:21:38,760 --> 00:21:40,640
Right. Heng's ahead of you in line.

402
00:21:40,880 --> 00:21:42,160
You wouldn't stand a chance.

403
00:21:44,280 --> 00:21:45,680
At least I'm in line!

404
00:21:46,160 --> 00:21:47,560
You're not even in the running.

405
00:21:47,800 --> 00:21:49,960
-Then why send me?
-Enough.

406
00:21:51,680 --> 00:21:53,960
Mother, stay still.

407
00:21:55,680 --> 00:21:58,240
Qiao, listen to me.

408
00:21:58,840 --> 00:22:00,640
We've just had a nasty fall.

409
00:22:00,720 --> 00:22:01,720
I think

410
00:22:02,840 --> 00:22:06,560
we should at least look
like we're behaving ourselves.

411
00:22:06,840 --> 00:22:08,360
You think I'm really getting involved?

412
00:22:09,640 --> 00:22:12,920
Yan's in the spotlight now.
Someone's bound to resent it.

413
00:22:14,200 --> 00:22:15,960
Let's sit back and watch them fight.

414
00:22:33,440 --> 00:22:35,400
Ma'am, I'm sorry.

415
00:22:35,560 --> 00:22:37,240
Young Master Xie's orders.

416
00:22:37,440 --> 00:22:40,440
Anyone caught shirking
gets a heavy punishment.

417
00:22:40,800 --> 00:22:42,320
I'm only taking one sack of rice.

418
00:22:42,400 --> 00:22:43,480
You're getting off lightly.

419
00:22:43,560 --> 00:22:44,840
Be more careful next time.

420
00:23:13,400 --> 00:23:15,960
My friend,
I know it's hard for everyone,

421
00:23:16,040 --> 00:23:18,840
but the new boss wants to make his mark.

422
00:23:18,920 --> 00:23:20,080
My hands are tied.

423
00:23:23,680 --> 00:23:24,680
Could it be--

424
00:23:26,200 --> 00:23:27,240
What's going on?

425
00:23:27,320 --> 00:23:29,080
The sun hasn't even set,
and you're quitting already?

426
00:23:29,440 --> 00:23:32,080
I submitted the materials list,
but the bookkeeper wouldn't approve it.

427
00:23:32,320 --> 00:23:34,120
Said a little hole like that

428
00:23:34,200 --> 00:23:36,040
wasn't worth spending so much
on materials to fix it.

429
00:23:36,120 --> 00:23:37,160
What kind of talk is that?

430
00:23:37,240 --> 00:23:39,400
He's accusing us of pocketing the silver!

431
00:23:39,480 --> 00:23:41,760
He even docked
all of today's wages!

432
00:23:41,840 --> 00:23:43,640
We're done.
Why stay and put up with this?

433
00:23:43,720 --> 00:23:44,800
Let's go! Let's go!

434
00:23:44,880 --> 00:23:46,600
-Let's go!
-How dare you!

435
00:23:46,880 --> 00:23:48,440
Get back here!
You--

436
00:23:49,040 --> 00:23:50,680
My lord,
they're rough men.

437
00:23:50,760 --> 00:23:51,920
Let me handle it for you.

438
00:23:52,880 --> 00:23:54,840
-All of you, come back!
-We quit!

439
00:23:55,280 --> 00:23:56,280
My lord, what do we do?

440
00:23:57,720 --> 00:23:59,080
We won't get anywhere by rushing.

441
00:24:00,200 --> 00:24:02,880
Contentment in quiet contemplation

442
00:24:02,960 --> 00:24:03,960
Heng,

443
00:24:06,400 --> 00:24:07,720
Father sent me to help you.

444
00:24:08,040 --> 00:24:09,320
Then why haven't you gone in?

445
00:24:09,840 --> 00:24:10,840
I can't stand him.

446
00:24:21,840 --> 00:24:25,760
It hurts! It hurts! It hurts!

447
00:24:27,200 --> 00:24:28,200
Drink.

448
00:24:32,440 --> 00:24:33,560
I won't, then.

449
00:24:33,960 --> 00:24:40,000
My hand, my back,
and my legs all hurt! I can't move!

450
00:24:40,120 --> 00:24:41,480
There's nothing wrong with your legs.

451
00:24:41,960 --> 00:24:42,960
Yes, there is!

452
00:24:43,200 --> 00:24:46,200
Just last month, someone
tripped me up so hard,

453
00:24:46,280 --> 00:24:47,320
I broke a bone!

454
00:24:47,720 --> 00:24:49,520
I won't have any, then.

455
00:24:55,320 --> 00:24:56,320
Easy! Easy! Easy!

456
00:25:04,440 --> 00:25:05,440
What are you doing?

457
00:25:05,560 --> 00:25:06,920
I'm hurt badly enough already!

458
00:25:07,000 --> 00:25:08,400
Trying to scald me to death?

459
00:25:08,760 --> 00:25:10,600
Why are you doing this to me?

460
00:25:10,680 --> 00:25:11,680
Let me.

461
00:25:20,640 --> 00:25:21,880
That's more like it.

462
00:25:22,960 --> 00:25:26,120
You know,
it takes a man to understand a man.

463
00:25:26,280 --> 00:25:29,280
No wonder Chengjiang
hasn't been home for days.

464
00:25:29,600 --> 00:25:32,440
With a shrew in the house,
who'd dare come back?

465
00:25:32,960 --> 00:25:35,880
Youqing is so much sweeter!

466
00:25:36,120 --> 00:25:37,680
That's enough.
Here, here, here.

467
00:25:42,600 --> 00:25:44,560
My face! My head!

468
00:25:45,080 --> 00:25:46,400
-You… you two…
-I don't know my own strength.

469
00:25:47,000 --> 00:25:48,320
You… you two…

470
00:25:48,920 --> 00:25:53,360
Grandmother! Youqing!
Help me!

471
00:25:53,880 --> 00:25:56,280
The Xies are killing me!

472
00:25:56,960 --> 00:25:57,960
Let me.

473
00:26:03,680 --> 00:26:04,760
What's going on here?

474
00:26:04,840 --> 00:26:07,320
Grandmother! Grandmother!

475
00:26:07,400 --> 00:26:09,880
Those two nearly killed me!

476
00:26:11,000 --> 00:26:12,720
He was the one
being so picky!

477
00:26:12,800 --> 00:26:15,280
He got hurt saving you.

478
00:26:15,640 --> 00:26:18,920
The least you can do is take care of him!

479
00:26:19,480 --> 00:26:21,600
Is this how the Xies treat their guests?

480
00:26:21,680 --> 00:26:25,600
If it is, I'll go to Madam
and demand an explanation!

481
00:26:26,600 --> 00:26:27,600
Wait.

482
00:26:34,440 --> 00:26:35,560
Fine. I'll apologize.

483
00:26:38,320 --> 00:26:39,800
You don't look happy about it.

484
00:26:39,880 --> 00:26:42,440
As if I were bullying you!

485
00:26:44,400 --> 00:26:46,720
Madam Huang, Mr. Huang,

486
00:26:46,880 --> 00:26:49,600
I was rude just now.
Please forgive me.

487
00:26:59,600 --> 00:27:01,320
If you want a fight, fight me openly!

488
00:27:01,680 --> 00:27:03,160
Why all these underhanded tricks?

489
00:27:03,240 --> 00:27:04,920
Slippery as an eel!

490
00:27:05,440 --> 00:27:07,240
Have some tea. Cool off.

491
00:27:11,400 --> 00:27:12,680
Think of it as a thank-you.

492
00:27:13,200 --> 00:27:14,200
A thank-you?

493
00:27:14,360 --> 00:27:15,440
For what?

494
00:27:15,520 --> 00:27:17,320
He's the one who brought those bandits!

495
00:27:17,760 --> 00:27:19,200
I chose not to dodge that sword.

496
00:27:19,440 --> 00:27:20,600
He deserved to get hurt.

497
00:27:21,160 --> 00:27:23,200
But
I don't understand Madam.

498
00:27:23,480 --> 00:27:25,240
Why let him stay and recover?

499
00:27:25,800 --> 00:27:27,080
You may need no one's help today,

500
00:27:27,360 --> 00:27:28,920
but you might tomorrow.

501
00:27:29,240 --> 00:27:31,600
We nearly became in-laws, after all.

502
00:27:33,080 --> 00:27:35,520
In-laws?
What in-laws?

503
00:27:36,840 --> 00:27:40,320
Stop!
Come back!

504
00:27:43,880 --> 00:27:45,080
Now that his legs are better,

505
00:27:45,160 --> 00:27:46,720
he's moving up in the world.

506
00:27:46,960 --> 00:27:47,960
Unlike me.

507
00:27:49,440 --> 00:27:50,760
I've got nothing.

508
00:27:51,680 --> 00:27:53,200
You're wonderful as you are, my lady.

509
00:27:53,400 --> 00:27:54,760
Of course I am!

510
00:27:54,920 --> 00:27:56,480
He just doesn't know what he's missing.

511
00:27:58,880 --> 00:28:00,000
When was the engagement broken off?

512
00:28:00,240 --> 00:28:02,040
Last winter.

513
00:28:03,920 --> 00:28:05,800
Last winter?

514
00:28:05,920 --> 00:28:07,320
No wonder.

515
00:28:07,640 --> 00:28:10,960
Someone else dumped him,
so he had to marry me.

516
00:28:11,280 --> 00:28:14,600
Now his precious girl is back,
and he can't take me to work.

517
00:28:14,680 --> 00:28:15,760
She might get the wrong idea!

518
00:28:15,840 --> 00:28:18,120
He told you not to go

519
00:28:18,200 --> 00:28:19,680
before the Huangs arrived.

520
00:28:19,880 --> 00:28:22,800
He might not even know they're here.

521
00:28:24,440 --> 00:28:26,840
And if they were about to get married,

522
00:28:27,640 --> 00:28:29,080
why go to all this trouble?

523
00:28:29,560 --> 00:28:31,360
They must have been turned down,

524
00:28:31,480 --> 00:28:32,680
so they're taking it out on you.

525
00:28:36,600 --> 00:28:38,200
Those weren't real bandits.

526
00:28:38,560 --> 00:28:41,280
For all we know,
he's faking his injuries, too.

527
00:28:47,440 --> 00:28:48,440
That wretch!

528
00:28:48,520 --> 00:28:50,480
And I even
stood up for you before the master!

529
00:28:59,000 --> 00:29:00,160
Break your word,

530
00:29:00,280 --> 00:29:02,160
and you'll have to
swallow a thousand needles!

531
00:29:02,240 --> 00:29:03,240
Dare you do that?

532
00:29:20,960 --> 00:29:22,560
You asked me if I hated you.

533
00:29:25,720 --> 00:29:26,800
I do hate you.

534
00:29:29,200 --> 00:29:31,200
The truth at last.

535
00:29:31,680 --> 00:29:34,240
First Master Xie won't let you
spend the household silver,

536
00:29:35,280 --> 00:29:37,160
and you won't ask him for it.

537
00:29:41,120 --> 00:29:42,120
It's my fault.

538
00:29:43,080 --> 00:29:44,400
All my fault. I'm useless.

539
00:29:45,400 --> 00:29:49,880
I finally earned some silver,
only to hand it all over.

540
00:29:50,640 --> 00:29:52,200
I'm going to the capital for the exam.

541
00:29:52,320 --> 00:29:53,720
I'll need money for everything.

542
00:29:54,600 --> 00:29:56,880
So I saved a little in secret.

543
00:30:03,720 --> 00:30:05,200
How old were you when you came here?

544
00:30:06,120 --> 00:30:07,560
Twelve.

545
00:30:08,360 --> 00:30:09,440
Twelve years old.

546
00:30:14,600 --> 00:30:17,920
In the blink of an eye,
10 years have passed.

547
00:30:18,560 --> 00:30:20,200
We've both been trapped here,

548
00:30:20,800 --> 00:30:22,560
together day in, day out.

549
00:30:26,920 --> 00:30:28,680
Do you think I can't tell

550
00:30:30,240 --> 00:30:32,320
when you're telling the truth

551
00:30:33,640 --> 00:30:35,920
and when you're lying?

552
00:30:44,320 --> 00:30:46,120
I'll break your legs!

553
00:30:46,960 --> 00:30:47,960
Mother!

554
00:30:48,200 --> 00:30:49,280
I'm not your mother!

555
00:30:49,680 --> 00:30:51,200
My lady, Lady Jin wishes to see you.

556
00:30:51,360 --> 00:30:53,960
She says it's urgent.
She needs to speak to Mr. Song.

557
00:30:56,600 --> 00:30:58,680
Lady Jin! My lady won't let you in!

558
00:30:59,480 --> 00:31:01,440
Lady Jin, you can't go in!

559
00:31:01,520 --> 00:31:02,520
Lady Jin!

560
00:31:06,560 --> 00:31:08,520
What's so urgent, Lady Jin?

561
00:31:09,520 --> 00:31:11,080
Let's hear it.

562
00:31:13,960 --> 00:31:15,680
My husband has a medical problem

563
00:31:15,880 --> 00:31:17,480
he'd rather keep private.

564
00:31:18,000 --> 00:31:19,480
I trust you, Aunt.

565
00:31:19,640 --> 00:31:21,440
It's my big mouth I don't trust.

566
00:31:21,760 --> 00:31:23,080
Once I've seen something,

567
00:31:23,720 --> 00:31:27,280
whether I should say it or not,
it all comes spilling out.

568
00:31:27,360 --> 00:31:28,720
Then keep your mouth shut.

569
00:31:33,920 --> 00:31:35,800
Not a word.

570
00:31:49,440 --> 00:31:51,240
Shanglin Inn
